{"id":"dd8d54af84f6f7dc","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-proof-height-bound.md","title":"通用证明树的序数高度界","display":"df-proof-height-bound — 通用证明树的序数高度界","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-proof-height-bound","aliases":["18-df-proof-height-bound","18-df-041"],"display":"df-proof-height-bound — 通用证明树的序数高度界","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]","[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-proof-height-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-proof-height-bound</span><span>18-df-041</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-height-bound — 通用证明树的序数高度界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a> 的规则实例集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>）。树的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{\\mathcal T},\\prec_{\\mathcal T},r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}\">\\(N_{\\mathcal T},\\prec_{\\mathcal T},r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}\\)</span> 均由被量化的五元组决定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 是集合函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 为上游合法五元组谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\\exists h\\,\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(h)=N_{\\mathcal T}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(h)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=s\\land h(r_{\\mathcal T})\\leq\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in N_{\\mathcal T}\\,(m\\prec_{\\mathcal T}n\\to h(m)&lt;h(n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\\exists h\\,\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(h)=N_{\\mathcal T}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(h)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=s\\land h(r_{\\mathcal T})\\leq\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall m,n\\in N_{\\mathcal T}\\,(m\\prec_{\\mathcal T}n\\to h(m)&lt;h(n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地通用高度标注接口；修正旧稿把量化树 T 与外面固定的 N,r,ℓ 混用的绑定错误。实际原书 Dρ^α 的规则及切秩下标定义在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a>，不由此节点自动得到切消。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集，$s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$（[[18-df-ordinal]]）。树的 $N_{\\mathcal T},\\prec_{\\mathcal T},r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}$ 均由被量化的五元组决定；$h$ 是集合函数。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集，$s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$（[[18-df-ordinal]]）。树的 $N_{\\mathcal T},\\prec_{\\mathcal T},r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}$ 均由被量化的五元组决定；$h$ 是集合函数。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本地通用高度标注接口；修正旧稿把量化树 T 与外面固定的 N,r,ℓ 混用的绑定错误。实际原书 Dρ^α 的规则及切秩下标定义在 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，不由此节点自动得到切消。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"N_{\\mathcal T},\\prec_{\\mathcal T},r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\\exists h\\,\\bigl(&\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(h)=N_{\\mathcal T}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(h)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=s\\land h(r_{\\mathcal T})\\leq\\alpha\\\\\n&\\land\\forall m,n\\in N_{\\mathcal T}\\,(m\\prec_{\\mathcal T}n\\to h(m)<h(n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1451,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3f01e4942d25070","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-height-bound]] 的规则集 $\\mathcal P$。$s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是序数类缩写。$h_{\\mathcal P}$ 仅定义于形式断言给出的域。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-proof-height-bound]]"},{"id":"6808c2b04eb4fb44","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"按 [[18-df-proof-height-bound]] 固定 $\\mathcal P,s$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。"},{"id":"a0aaf8f9752eb6f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"按 [[18-df-proof-height-bound]] 固定 $\\mathcal P,s$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-height-bound]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-height-bound|18-df-proof-height-bound]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-height-bound|18-df-proof-height-bound]]"}],"outgoing":["68c5bcff4a164cd8","cf95026e035bcb2b","8accc2f8cbc49eab"]}